"a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":16,"p":[0,0],"r":[3,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Eunomius the Anomoean, bp. of Cyzicus, against whose Liber Apologeticus Basil wrote his counter-work. The first appearance of the αίρετικὸς a!nqrwpoj , the \"chooser\" of his own way rather than the common sense of the Church, is in Tit. iii. 10. αίρετίζειν is a common word in the LXX., but does not occur in Is. xlii. 1, though it is introduced into the quotation in Matt. xii. 18. a$iresij"},{"id":"3e530ddc1183","v":"npnf.basilius.epistulae","w":"basilius.epistulae","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":22,"p":[1,1],"r":[3,2],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Tit. iii. 2."},{"id":"c356f4f49f08","v":"npnf.basilius.epistulae","w":"basilius.epistulae","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":22,"p":[1,1],"r":[2,15],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Tit. ii. 15."},{"id":"f68c988e05a7","v":"npnf.basilius.epistulae","w":"basilius.epistulae","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":22,"p":[3,3],"r":[3,2],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"cf . Tit. iii. 2."},{"id":"f66979728c6d","v":"npnf.basilius.epistulae","w":"basilius.epistulae","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":22,"p":[3,3],"r":[1,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Tit. i. 10."},{"id":"a09311140668","v":"npnf.basilius.epistulae","w":"basilius.epistulae","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":22,"p":[4,4],"r":[3,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Tit. iii. 10."},{"id":"0fdf9f093849","v":"npnf.basilius.epistulae","w":"basilius.epistulae","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":22,"p":[4,4],"r":[2,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"cf . Tit. ii. 8."},{"id":"330a019235d6","v":"npnf.basilius.epistulae","w":"basilius.epistulae","a":"basilius_von_casarea","s":225,"p":[1,1],"r":[1,10],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"From Letter ccxxxvii. it would appear that Deomsthenes was now in Galati